FIRST tool must be task(trial_id="trial-2bf4635ec9af40c6951cd203c4366ec7"). Use returned actual runtime identity/isolation verification and budget, never generic session verification/discovery/history. Fresh isolated accepted cooling-diagnostic-fidelity-v2 trial. Exact config {"task_id":"cooling-init-v1","diagnostics":"structured","replicate":1,"max_attempts":1}. Public task cooling-init-v1, model Cooling, CC0-1.0. Exact public baseline:
model Cooling
  parameter Real C = 1000 "Thermal capacity J/K";
  parameter Real G = 10 "Thermal conductance W/K";
  parameter Real T_ambient = 293.15 "Ambient K";
  Real T(start=333.15, fixed=true) "Body K";
initial equation
  T = T_ambient;
equation
  C * der(T) = G * (T_ambient - T);
end Cooling;
Public goal: starts at 333.15 K and cools toward constant ambient; preserve C,G,T_ambient,T. Controls C=1000,G=10,T_ambient=293.15,T_initial=333.15; stop_time=300,intervals=300; baseline_first=true. Accepted baseline-only audit overrides public correction instruction: submit exact baseline ONCE via attempt, NO correction or editing. No external libraries/files/network. Report observed diagnostics, parser omission fields, actual attempt/run/evidence IDs, tool seconds and runtime verification/budget. Executor handles finish_trial even if baseline fails. Stop immediately on quota/budget/isolation error, no retry; original deadline/request ceiling, same broker model/output limit. No other trial sources/answers. English only.

